    "message": "Move test_staff_task_order_effect.py under tests/unit/domain\n\nOnly the file move, named after the module whose orders it checks\n(domain/staff_operations.py), so its history stays traceable. The next\ncommit explains in Japanese why an order without a qualified worker is\nrefused (#75).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
