    "message": "Explain why a staff order no worker can take is refused\n\nGenerated Scenarios staff no one for cleaning or maintenance: in a\nshelter that work falls to evacuee rotas, the facility manager or\ncontractors, and repairs are ordered with facility_repair. An order for\nsuch a task was refused with an internal English message (#75).\n\nThe preflight now answers in Japanese, with a code the UI already shows\nas is. no_qualified_staff says no one has the skill and points to\nset_staff_role (and to facility_repair for maintenance);\nstaff_lacks_task_skill names the workers who could take the order.\n\nThe simulation is unchanged. docs/simulation-models.md records why the\ngenerator staffs no cleaners or maintenance workers, and that zone\nsanitation keeps falling in long runs until a model restores it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
